<title>DENMARK: Moeller orders ships in China.</title>
<headline>Moeller orders ships in China.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish shipping, oil and gas group A.P. Moeller said on Wednesday it had placed an order for two new product tanker ships with China's Dalian New Shipyard.</p>
<p>It said the vessels, each with 110,000 tonnes deadweight and 120,000 cubic metre capacity, were due for delivery by end-1998.</p>
<p>&quot;(The order) will strengthen Moeller's position in this market sector,&quot; it said in a statement. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
</text>
